<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"/><title>Privacy | RIPL Wealth Money at Work</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/money-at-work/style.css"/></head><body><header class="header"><div class="wrap nav"><a class="brand" href="/"><img src="/ripl-logo.png" alt="RIPL Wealth" width="112" height="48"/></a><a href="/">Return to the website →</a></div></header><main class="wrap section" style="max-width:800px"><p class="eyebrow">PRIVACY</p><h1>Privacy and your information</h1><p>This public informational website does not accept tax returns, account numbers, or financial documents. Do not send those items through email or ordinary contact forms. This page offers an educational quiz, an optional full report unlock, and an optional introductory booking. It does not upload documents. After an introductory conversation, RIPL can provide instructions for securely sharing documents if needed. Do not email tax returns through ordinary, unencrypted email.</p><h2>Nine-question quiz</h2><p>The nine-question quiz runs in your browser. Quiz progress is temporary and clears when you refresh or close the page. After completion, a portion of your educational report appears without requiring an email address. If you choose to unlock the complete report, your email address, all nine quiz answers, and whether you separately opted in to educational marketing emails are sent through a same-site Cloudflare Worker to Resend, an independent third-party email delivery provider. Resend processes the submission to send a lead notification to Adam Kasick at RIPL Wealth. The complete report is then displayed in your browser; it is not automatically emailed to you. You can save it as a PDF or initiate an email using your own email application. Resend and the receiving email provider may retain message data according to their policies; the submitted information will also appear in Adam’s email inbox. The website does not separately store the answers in a database. Marketing emails are optional and not a condition of unlocking the report. Resend uses its own privacy practices; learn more at <a href="https://resend.com/legal/privacy-policy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Resend</a>. Please do not enter sensitive account numbers, tax identifiers, or financial documents.</p><h2>Referral and campaign information</h2><p>When you arrive from an advertisement, referral source information in your URL (such as UTM campaign parameters) may be remembered for the duration of your browser session and carried into the external booking URL. No tax-return information is included in this tracking.</p><h2>Advertising conversion measurement</h2><p>This site uses the OpenAI Ads Measurement Pixel to measure visits and actions such as quiz completion, successful report requests, and confirmed bookings attributable to advertising. The pixel may use first-party browser identifiers and an advertising click reference to help attribute events. The conversion events we intentionally send do not include your quiz answers, account balances, or other financial responses. Depending on the pixel settings, supported contact information entered into forms may be automatically hashed in your browser for conversion matching. OpenAI and your browser may apply their own measurement and privacy settings. Contact RIPL Wealth for questions about this measurement.</p><h2>Third-party links and videos</h2><p>YouTube, your calendar provider, and any separately arranged secure document-sharing provider have their own privacy practices. Apart from the advertising measurement described above, we do not currently enable a general site analytics collector by default. Please consult the linked services' privacy information before entering data.</p><h2>Questions?</h2><p>Visit <a href="https://riplwealth.com/">riplwealth.com</a> for firm information and disclosures. <a href="/">Return to the landing page</a>.</p></main></body></html>
